<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech IPS 9mo consolidated gross rises.</title>
<headline>Czech IPS 9mo consolidated gross rises.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary consolidated results for the Czech builder IPS for nine months ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		213.7	  vs	 180.1</p>
</text>
